pistomp-audio (1.0.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. Extends rtirq (which can only work with Pi 5) with
    a custom script that discovers I2S audio device IRQs on Pi 3/4 and
    changes them to RT priority 90 via chrt. Replaces the stage2-baked
    rtirq.service (removed and masked).

